function skinById(id){return MG_SKINS.find(s=>s.id===id)||MG_SKINS[0]}
function layoutThumb(skin){const l=skin.layout;return `<svg viewBox="0 0 320 180" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Composição ${escapeHTML(skin.name)}"><defs><linearGradient id="bg-${skin.id}" x2="0" y2="1"><stop stop-color="#b0c8c0"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#e1e4c1"/></linearGradient></defs><rect width="320" height="180" fill="url(#bg-${skin.id})"/><path d="M0 101Q70 68 150 91T320 87V180H0" fill="#668777"/><path d="M35 126V56H255V126Z" fill="#e2e2ca"/><path d="M30 57L145 24L264 57Z" fill="#466e65"/><path d="M48 69H100V105H48ZM116 69H168V105H116ZM184 69H242V105H184Z" fill="#37645e"/><path d="M110 180L142 125H176L212 180" fill="#c5cab1"/>${Object.entries(l).map(([key,[x,y,w,h]])=>`<rect x="${x*3.2}" y="${y*1.8}" width="${w*3.2}" height="${h*1.8}" rx="${Math.min(skin.radius,6)}" fill="${skin.panel}" opacity=".88" stroke="${skin.color}" stroke-width=".8"/><text x="${(x+2)*3.2}" y="${(y+Math.min(h*.65,7))*1.8}" fill="${skin.panel==='#f1e9e2'?'#273e36':'#fff'}" font-size="${key==='brand'?7:5}">${({brand:'SUA MARCA · 360°',scene:'AMBIENTE ATUAL',dock:'⌂  ‹  ＋  −  ›',menu:'AMBIENTES'})[key]}</text>`).join('')}</svg>`}
